  <description>
    Generic product box placeholder (80 mm cube).
    Actual good/defective instances are spawned dynamically by
    product_spawner.py with inline SDF; this entry silences the
    gzclient "Missing model.config" error for the product_boxes folder.
  </description>
</model>
